- What percent DNA do you share with your aunt?

=== layout: section

# What percent DNA do you share with your aunt? 50% offspring (mother to son) &#215; 50% sisters (mother to aunt) = 25% DNA shared

=== layout: section

# What percent DNA do you share with your grandfather&#8217;s sister&#8217;s kids?

=== layout: section

# What percent DNA do you share with your grandfather&#8217;s sister&#8217;s kids? 25% grandfather &#215; 50% sibling (gpa to sister) &#215; 50% offspring (sister to kid) = 0.25&#215;0.5&#215;0.5 = 6.25%

