The [Closed Loop Method]{color=red} for Calculating the [Coefficient of Inbreeding (COI)]{color=purple}

=== layout: one-panel
@replaceme

# *Allelic Identity by Descent*

@body

- In human genetics, geneticists wish to calculate the inbreeding coefficient of a particular individual whose pedigree is known.
- The method they use is called [*Closed loop method*]{color=red underline=true}
  - [*Identity by descent*]{underline=true} &#8211; the condition in which two alleles are both replicas of a single ancestral allele in the recent past (same nucleotide sequence).

